    <string name="libreread_privacy_title">Before the first article</string>
    <string name="libreread_privacy_notice">To write an article, LibreRead sends the video ID, title, creator, transcript text and your writing instructions to the LibreRead article service at %1$s, with this device\'s credential. The service uses an AI model provider (currently through OpenRouter) to write the article.\n\nIf the device finds no usable captions, the service is asked to transcribe the video from its public YouTube address with an AI model.\n\nYour subscriptions, history and other app data are not sent. Articles and transcripts are stored only on this device. They, and the credential, are left out of Android backups.</string>
